{"id": "tea:drg-drsya-viveka:1", "source": "src:drg-drsya-viveka", "location": {"ref": "1"}, "original": {"text": "rūpaṃ dṛśyaṃ locanaṃ dṛk tad dṛśyaṃ dṛk tu mānasam / dṛśyā dhīvṛttayaḥ sākṣī dṛg eva na tu dṛśyate", "script": "IAST", "edition": "vulgate wording recalled from memory (verify against an edition)", "licence": "public domain (pre-modern text)"}, "paraphrase": "Form is seen and the eye is its seer; the eye is seen and the mind is its seer; the mind's modes are seen and the witness is their seer — the witness is never seen.", "tags": {"level": "bridging", "standpoint": "analytic", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "intermediate"}, "types": ["consciousness-mind"], "terms": ["trm:saksin"], "concepts": ["cpt:saksin"], "practices": ["prc:drg-drsya-viveka", "prc:saksi-bhava"], "notes": "Authorship disputed (Bhāratītīrtha, Vidyāraṇya or Śaṅkara).", "teachers": ["tch:bharatitirtha"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U13-advaita"], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U13-advaita"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:drg-drsya-viveka:20", "source": "src:drg-drsya-viveka", "location": {"ref": "20"}, "original": {"text": "asti bhāti priyaṃ rūpaṃ nāma cety aṃśapañcakam / ādyatrayaṃ brahmarūpaṃ jagadrūpaṃ tato dvayam", "script": "IAST", "edition": "vulgate wording recalled from memory (verify against an edition)", "licence": "public domain (pre-modern text)"}, "paraphrase": "Every thing has five aspects: it is, it shines, it is dear, and it has a name and a form; the first three belong to Brahman, the last two to the world.", "tags": {"level": "bridging", "standpoint": "analytic", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "intermediate"}, "types": ["ultimate", "world-fate"], "terms": ["trm:nama-rupa", "trm:saccidananda"], "concepts": ["cpt:sat-cit-ananda"], "practices": ["prc:nirguna-upasana"], "teachers": ["tch:bharatitirtha"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U13-advaita"], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U13-advaita"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:drg-drsya-viveka:23-30", "source": "src:drg-drsya-viveka", "location": {"ref": "23-30"}, "paraphrase": "Six samādhis: within the heart, savikalpa attended by objects of the mind, savikalpa attended by words ('I am unattached consciousness'), and nirvikalpa; and the same three applied to external objects (separating being-shining-dear from name and form); one should spend one's time in these.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "seeker", "naya": null, "path": ["meditation", "knowledge"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["practice"], "concepts": ["cpt:samadhi-advaita"], "practices": ["prc:savikalpa-samadhi", "prc:nirvikalpa-samadhi"], "teachers": ["tch:bharatitirtha"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U13-advaita"], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U13-advaita"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:drg-drsya-viveka:32-37", "source": "src:drg-drsya-viveka", "location": {"ref": "32-37"}, "paraphrase": "The jīva is threefold: the absolute (pāramārthika) jīva delimited by the body but in truth Brahman; the empirical (vyāvahārika) jīva, the reflection in the intellect imagined by māyā; and the illusory (prātibhāsika) jīva, the dream-self; each superimposed on the former.", "tags": {"level": "bridging", "standpoint": "analytic", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["consciousness-mind"], "terms": ["trm:paramarthika", "trm:vyavaharika", "trm:pratibhasika"], "concepts": ["cpt:three-kinds-of-jiva", "cpt:three-levels-of-reality"], "teachers": ["tch:bharatitirtha"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U13-advaita"], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "low", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U13-advaita"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
